#: ../../source/docs/modules/restserver.rst:3 187269ba24fe45f39c17d057faa5cfd9
msgid "REST Publisher"
msgstr "REST 发布者"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/restserver.rst:9 2547ce232f4d43f7815bd4078058be76
msgid "Publishes MAVLink messages to a REST server."
msgstr "将 MAVLink 消息发布到 REST 服务器。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/restserver.rst:11
#: 54046227acb24d8f8de06c5c393491df
msgid ""
"This module requires the ``flask`` and ``Werkzeug`` Python packages to be "
"installed."
msgstr "该模块需要安装 ``flask`` 和 ``Werkzeug`` Python 包。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/restserver.rst:13
#: ec80dc3487064a56bba7ca33e4ad2dd5
msgid ""
"The IP and address of the server can be set by (for example) ``restserver "
"address 127.0.0.1:4777``. The default address is ``localhost:5000``."
msgstr ""
"服务器的 IP 和地址可通过（例如） ``restserver address 127.0.0.1:4777`` 设置。默认地址为 "
"``localhost:5000``。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/restserver.rst:16
#: e8e70865d0574f25b543ae47d01bd567
msgid ""
"The server can be started and stopped via the ``restserver start`` and "
"``restserver stop`` respectively."
msgstr "服务器可通过 ``restserver start`` 和 ``restserver stop`` 分别启动和停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/restserver.rst:19
#: 2b803f29c87d4619ad3ad07be1adfc59
msgid ""
"When the server is running, messages will be available from the endpoint "
"``http://localhost:5000/rest/mavlink`` (using the default IP and port) in "
"JSON format."
msgstr ""
"服务器运行时，消息将以 JSON 格式从端点 ``http://localhost:5000/rest/mavlink`` 获取（使用默认 IP "
"和端口）。"
